      "writtenOn": "2024-12-02T22:01:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what\u0027s your actual goal here? because if you\u0027re fine with a bit of pinning, you don\u0027t need to go this far --- GetByteArrayElements()/ReleaseByteArrayElements() will work too.\n\ndid the ART GC folks tell you pinning was a problem, or just to avoid the criticals?",
      "revId": "78033b77795fd5d0d56d56a973543c3993af3e76",
